D E V O P S 

D - Development: The process of designing and creating software applications.

E - Efficiency: Streamlining processes to improve productivity and reduce waste.

V - Value: Delivering high-quality products that meet customer needs and expectations.

O - Operations: Managing IT infrastructure and services to ensure reliability and performance.

P - Performance: Monitoring and optimizing application and system performance.

S - Security: Implementing practices to protect applications and data from threats.
